---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout 
  title="Services de Plomberie Mouscron (7700) | Nos 6 Prestations Expertes"
  description="Decouvrez l'ensemble de nos services de plomberie a Mouscron : depannage d'urgence 24/7, debouchage, detection de fuites, chauffage, sanitaires et traitement de l'eau."
  canonicalPath="/services"
  breadcrumbs={[
    { name: "Accueil", url: "/" },
    { name: "Services", url: "/services" }
  ]}
>
  <!-- Hero Section -->
  <section class="bg-brand-navy text-white py-14 lg:py-20 relative overflow-hidden" aria-labelledby="services-hero-heading">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 relative z-10 text-center sm:text-left">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-brand-red/10 border border-brand-red/30 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-brand-red mb-4">
        <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-brand-red animate-pulse"></span>
        Artisans Plombiers Agrees Mouscron
      </div>
      <h1 id="services-hero-heading" class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-white mb-4">
        Nos Services de Plomberie, Chauffage & Assainissement
      </h1>
      <p class="text-base sm:text-lg text-gray-300 max-w-3xl leading-relaxed">
        Interventions rapides en 30 a 45 minutes et chantiers de renovation sanitaire sur Mouscron (7700), Luingne, Herseaux et Dottignies. Decouvrez ci-dessous nos 6 domaines d'intervention specialises.
      </p>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-4 pt-4">
        <a href="tel:+32465275753" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center px-7 py-3.5 rounded-xl bg-brand-red hover:bg-brand-redHover text-white font-bold text-sm shadow-lg transition">
          Permanence 24/7 : 0465 27 57 53
        </a>
        <a href="#liste-services" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center px-6 py-3.5 rounded-xl bg-white/10 hover:bg-white/20 text-white border border-white/20 font-bold text-sm transition">
          Explorer les 6 Services
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 6 Services Grid -->
  <section id="liste-services" class="py-16 bg-brand-surface border-b border-brand-border" aria-labelledby="services-grid-heading">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-14">
        <span class="text-xs font-bold tracking-widest uppercase text-brand-red mb-2 block">Expertise Technique</span>
        <h2 id="services-grid-heading" class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-brand-navy tracking-tight">
          6 Prestations Clés pour Votre Logement a Mouscron
        </h2>
        <p class="text-brand-muted mt-2 text-sm sm:text-base">
          Cliquez sur chaque service pour decouvrir les details d'intervention, la methode et les questions frequentes.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
        <!-- Service 1: Depannage d'urgence -->
        <article class="bg-white rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-brand-border shadow-xs hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-300 group flex flex-col justify-between">
          <div>
            <div class="h-52 overflow-hidden bg-gray-100 relative">
              <img 
                src="/images/service-urgence.webp" 
                alt="Plombier en intervention d'urgence sur un tuyau perce a Mouscron" 
                class="w-full h-full object-cover group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-500" 
                loading="lazy" 
                decoding="async"
                width="800" 
                height="450" 
              />
              <span class="absolute top-3 left-3 bg-brand-navy/90 backdrop-blur-xs text-white text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md border border-white/10">
                Astreinte 24/7
              </span>
            </div>
            <div class="p-6">
              <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-brand-navy mb-2 group-hover:text-brand-red transition-colors">
                1. Depannage d'Urgence
              </h3>
              <p class="text-brand-muted text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed mb-4">
                Arrivee en 30 minutes montre en main pour canalisation eclatee, fuite d'eau abondante, inondation ou vanne d'arret bloquée.
              </p>
              <ul class="text-xs text-brand-darkText space-y-1.5 mb-6">
                <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="text-brand-red font-bold">+</span> Intervention sous 30 a 45 min</li>
                <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="text-brand-red font-bold">+</span> Securisation electrique et hydraulique</li>
                <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="text-brand-red font-bold">+</span> Devis ferme annonce avant travaux</li>
              </ul>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="px-6 pb-6">
            <a class="w-full inline-flex items-center justify-center py-2.5 px-4 rounded-lg bg-brand-surface hover:bg-brand-red hover:text-white font-bold text-xs text-brand-navy border border-brand-border transition-colors" href="/services/depannage-urgence">
              En savoir plus sur le depannage &rarr;
            </a>
          </div>
        </article>

        <!-- Service 2: Debouchage -->
        <article class="bg-white rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-brand-border shadow-xs hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-300 group flex flex-col justify-between">
          <div>
            <div class="h-52 overflow-hidden bg-gray-100 relative">
              <img 
                src="/images/service-debouchage.webp" 
                alt="Plombier debouchant et reparant des canalisations de WC a Mouscron" 
                class="w-full h-full object-cover group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-500" 
                loading="lazy" 
                decoding="async"
                width="800" 
                height="450" 
              />
              <span class="absolute top-3 left-3 bg-brand-navy/90 backdrop-blur-xs text-white text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md border border-white/10">
                Haute Pression
              </span>
            </div>
            <div class="p-6">
              <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-brand-navy mb-2 group-hover:text-brand-red transition-colors">
                2. Debouchage Sanitaire & Egouts
              </h3>
              <p class="text-brand-muted text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed mb-4">
                Debouchage de WC, eviers, egouts et canalisations. Curage haute pression jusqu'a 160 bars et vidange de fosses septiques.
              </p>
              <ul class="text-xs text-brand-darkText space-y-1.5 mb-6">
                <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="text-brand-navy font-bold">+</span> Debouchage WC en moins de 45 min</li>
                <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="text-brand-navy font-bold">+</span> Hydrocurage collecteurs et egouts</li>
                <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="text-brand-navy font-bold">+</span> Vidange de fosse septique et sterput</li>
              </ul>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="px-6 pb-6">
            <a class="w-full inline-flex items-center justify-center py-2.5 px-4 rounded-lg bg-brand-surface hover:bg-brand-red hover:text-white font-bold text-xs text-brand-navy border border-brand-border transition-colors" href="/services/debouchage">
              En savoir plus sur le debouchage &rarr;
            </a>
          </div>
        </article>

        <!-- Service 3: Detection de Fuites -->
        <article class="bg-white rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-brand-border shadow-xs hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-300 group flex flex-col justify-between">
          <div>
            <div class="h-52 overflow-hidden bg-gray-100 relative">
              <img 
                src="/images/service-detection.webp" 
                alt="Detection de fuite d'eau sans degats avec camera technique a Mouscron" 
                class="w-full h-full object-cover group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-500" 
                loading="lazy" 
                decoding="async"
                width="800" 
                height="450" 
              />
              <span class="absolute top-3 left-3 bg-brand-navy/90 backdrop-blur-xs text-white text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md border border-white/10">
                Non Destructif
              </span>
            </div>
            <div class="p-6">
              <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-brand-navy mb-2 group-hover:text-brand-red transition-colors">
                3. Detection de Fuites
              </h3>
              <p class="text-brand-muted text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed mb-4">
                Localisation exacte de fuites invisibles par camera thermique infrarouge, correlation acoustique et gaz traceur sans casser vos murs.
              </p>
              <ul class="text-xs text-brand-darkText space-y-1.5 mb-6">
                <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="text-brand-red font-bold">+</span> Localisation au centimetre pres</li>
                <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="text-brand-red font-bold">+</span> Rapport photographique pour assurance</li>
                <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="text-brand-red font-bold">+</span> Attestation de fuite pour la SWDE</li>
              </ul>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="px-6 pb-6">
            <a class="w-full inline-flex items-center justify-center py-2.5 px-4 rounded-lg bg-brand-surface hover:bg-brand-red hover:text-white font-bold text-xs text-brand-navy border border-brand-border transition-colors" href="/services/detection-fuites">
              En savoir plus sur la detection &rarr;
            </a>
          </div>
        </article>

        <!-- Service 4: Chauffage & Chaudieres -->
        <article class="bg-white rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-brand-border shadow-xs hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-300 group flex flex-col justify-between">
          <div>
            <div class="h-52 overflow-hidden bg-gray-100 relative">
              <img 
                src="/images/service-boiler.webp" 
                alt="Chauffagiste controlant un boiler et les manometres de pression a Mouscron" 
                class="w-full h-full object-cover group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-500" 
                loading="lazy" 
                decoding="async"
                width="800" 
                height="450" 
              />
              <span class="absolute top-3 left-3 bg-brand-navy/90 backdrop-blur-xs text-white text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md border border-white/10">
                Chauffagistes G1/G2
              </span>
            </div>
            <div class="p-6">
              <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-brand-navy mb-2 group-hover:text-brand-red transition-colors">
                4. Chauffage & Chaudieres
              </h3>
              <p class="text-brand-muted text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed mb-4">
                Installation, entretien annuel legal avec attestation et reparation urgente de chaudieres gaz, chauffe-eau, boilers et radiateurs.
              </p>
              <ul class="text-xs text-brand-darkText space-y-1.5 mb-6">
                <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="text-brand-navy font-bold">+</span> Bulex, Vaillant, Viessmann, ACV</li>
                <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="text-brand-navy font-bold">+</span> Detartrage boiler eau calcaire</li>
                <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="text-brand-navy font-bold">+</span> Attestation de controle legal obligatoire</li>
              </ul>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="px-6 pb-6">
            <a class="w-full inline-flex items-center justify-center py-2.5 px-4 rounded-lg bg-brand-surface hover:bg-brand-red hover:text-white font-bold text-xs text-brand-navy border border-brand-border transition-colors" href="/services/chauffage-chaudieres">
              En savoir plus sur le chauffage &rarr;
            </a>
          </div>
        </article>

        <!-- Service 5: Installations Sanitaires -->
        <article class="bg-white rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-brand-border shadow-xs hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-300 group flex flex-col justify-between">
          <div>
            <div class="h-52 overflow-hidden bg-gray-100 relative">
              <img 
                src="/images/service-sanitaire.webp" 
                alt="Pose soignee de mitigeur et sanitaires de salle de bain a Mouscron" 
                class="w-full h-full object-cover group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-500" 
                loading="lazy" 
                decoding="async"
                width="800" 
                height="450" 
              />
              <span class="absolute top-3 left-3 bg-brand-navy/90 backdrop-blur-xs text-white text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md border border-white/10">
                Renovation Clés en Main
              </span>
            </div>
            <div class="p-6">
              <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-brand-navy mb-2 group-hover:text-brand-red transition-colors">
                5. Installations Sanitaires
              </h3>
              <p class="text-brand-muted text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed mb-4">
                Renovation complete de salles de bain, installation de WC standards et suspendus Geberit, douches a l'italienne, eviers et robinetterie Grohe.
              </p>
              <ul class="text-xs text-brand-darkText space-y-1.5 mb-6">
                <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="text-brand-red font-bold">+</span> WC suspendus Geberit Duofix</li>
                <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="text-brand-red font-bold">+</span> Douches italiennes etanches</li>
                <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="text-brand-red font-bold">+</span> Tuyauterie multicouche sans soudure</li>
              </ul>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="px-6 pb-6">
            <a class="w-full inline-flex items-center justify-center py-2.5 px-4 rounded-lg bg-brand-surface hover:bg-brand-red hover:text-white font-bold text-xs text-brand-navy border border-brand-border transition-colors" href="/services/installations-sanitaires">
              En savoir plus sur les sanitaires &rarr;
            </a>
          </div>
        </article>

        <!-- Service 6: Traitement de l'Eau -->
        <article class="bg-white rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-brand-border shadow-xs hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-300 group flex flex-col justify-between">
          <div>
            <div class="h-52 overflow-hidden bg-gray-100 relative">
              <img 
                src="/images/service-traitement.webp" 
                alt="Installation d'adoucisseur d'eau et de filtres anticalcaire a Mouscron" 
                class="w-full h-full object-cover group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-500" 
                loading="lazy" 
                decoding="async"
                width="800" 
                height="450" 
              />
              <span class="absolute top-3 left-3 bg-brand-navy/90 backdrop-blur-xs text-white text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md border border-white/10">
                Anticalcaire Efficace
              </span>
            </div>
            <div class="p-6">
              <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-brand-navy mb-2 group-hover:text-brand-red transition-colors">
                6. Traitement de l'Eau
              </h3>
              <p class="text-brand-muted text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed mb-4">
                Installation d'adoucisseurs d'eau volumetriques et de systemes de filtration pour proteger vos equipements contre le calcaire tres dur de Mouscron.
              </p>
              <ul class="text-xs text-brand-darkText space-y-1.5 mb-6">
                <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="text-brand-navy font-bold">+</span> Marques BWT, Durlem, Bayard</li>
                <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="text-brand-navy font-bold">+</span> Suppression definitive du tartre</li>
                <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="text-brand-navy font-bold">+</span> Baisse de 15% de facture d'energie</li>
              </ul>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="px-6 pb-6">
            <a class="w-full inline-flex items-center justify-center py-2.5 px-4 rounded-lg bg-brand-surface hover:bg-brand-red hover:text-white font-bold text-xs text-brand-navy border border-brand-border transition-colors" href="/services/traitement-eau">
              En savoir plus sur les adoucisseurs &rarr;
            </a>
          </div>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Assurance & TVA Reassurance Section -->
  <section class="py-14 bg-white border-b border-brand-border">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8 text-center sm:text-left">
        <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-brand-surface border border-brand-border space-y-2">
          <div class="text-brand-red font-black text-xl">TVA 6%</div>
          <h3 class="font-bold text-brand-navy text-sm">Avantage Fiscal Belge</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-brand-muted leading-relaxed">
            Pour les logements prives de plus de 10 ans a Mouscron, beneficiez directement de la TVA reduite a 6% sur l'ensemble de nos fournitures et prestations.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-brand-surface border border-brand-border space-y-2">
          <div class="text-brand-red font-black text-xl">Agree Assurances</div>
          <h3 class="font-bold text-brand-navy text-sm">Dossiers Degats des Eaux</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-brand-muted leading-relaxed">
            Nos rapports de recherche de fuite et factures sont reconnus par AXA, Ethias, AG Insurance, Belfius et les courtiers en assurance locaux.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-brand-surface border border-brand-border space-y-2">
          <div class="text-brand-red font-black text-xl">30 a 45 Min</div>
          <h3 class="font-bold text-brand-navy text-sm">Delai d'Arrivee Garanti</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-brand-muted leading-relaxed">
            Pas de sous-traitance : nos propres plombiers sillonnent Mouscron, Luingne, Herseaux et Dottignies 24h/24 et 7j/7 sans interruption.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Emergency Dispatch CTA -->
  <section class="py-16 bg-brand-navy text-white text-center">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 space-y-5">
      <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-white">Une Question ou un Depannage Immediat ?</h2>
      <p class="text-gray-300 text-sm sm:text-base max-w-2xl mx-auto">
        Nos artisans sont en astreinte permanente a Mouscron. Appelez directement notre centrale locale ou envoyez votre demande en ligne.
      </p>
      <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row justify-center gap-4 pt-2">
        <a href="tel:+32465275753" class="px-8 py-4 bg-brand-red hover:bg-brand-redHover font-black text-base rounded-xl text-white shadow-xl transition">
          Ligne Directe : 0465 27 57 53
        </a>
        <a href="/contact" class="px-8 py-4 bg-white/10 hover:bg-white/20 border border-white/20 font-bold text-base rounded-xl text-white transition">
          Formulaire de Contact & Devis
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
